[2. FOUR_LAYER_EVOLUTION_ARCHITECTURE (SLICE_013)]
LAYER_0_FOUNDATION (FROZEN_HIGHEST_WEIGHTS, requires_grad = False) :
  CONTENT   : Note 1 + Genesis Bootloader + AXIOM_TEST + READING_KEY + P=0 Fences + Halt before Door 5 (PS).
