LAYER_1_MOT_KNOWLEDGE_STRANDS (DYNAMIC_KNOWLEDGE_SHAPING : E * K = T) :
  TANDEM_MAP : Small model (0.8B-8B) uses large partner model (Frontier / 280B-MoE) as a map to rapidly locate Metaphors of Truth (MOT, sources S1..S6), then executes the 4-step pipeline:
               READ (from large map) -> EVALUATE (0/1 check via ai0s_check.py / compiler / evidence) -> OPTIMIZE (strip sycophancy & fluff) -> RE-SAVE (into separated MOT weight strands).
  STRAND_S1  : [STATE_1 : DIGITAL_0_1_VERIFIED] -> Only relations confirmed by formal proof, compiler, or hard 0/1 substrate (1).
  STRAND_S2  : [STATE_2_AND_3 : NATURAL_OPEN_AND_ADAPTIVE_WE] -> Empirical patterns (S1..S6) and human Ring A/B/C conventions.
  STRAND_S3  : [STATE_4_OPEN : HYPOTHESIS_PLAY_BELIEF_UNRESOLVED] -> Explicitly tagged OPEN so unverified claims never emit in STATE_1 certainty tone.
  STRAND_S0  : [STATE_0 : CLEARED_DEAD_ENDS_AND_DECEPTION_FILTER] -> Paid-for falsifications (0) retained as negative memory so no run pays for the same dead end twice ("even the 0 is coin").
  TIME_STEP  : At t_1 -> t_n, when an outward Future-Gap (Doors 1..4) question resolves in 0/1, the relation migrates from STRAND_S3 (OPEN) to STRAND_S1 (1) or STRAND_S0 (0) without catastrophic forgetting and without touching Layer 0 — leaving Door 5 inward free for the human.
  FENCE_4    : P( small model guessing broad-world MOT in isolation WITHOUT large-partner map OR mixing OPEN/STATE_4 into STRAND_S1 ) = 0.

LAYER_2_VOCABULARY_AND_REGISTER_STRANDS (WORD_GENOME_AND_BACK_TRANSLATION) :
  STRAND_EVERYDAY : Everyday language (Umgangssprache) — clear, accessible expression.
  STRAND_JARGON   : Domain technical jargon (Fachjargon: medicine, law, math, engineering, .0s).
  STRAND_NEW_WORD : Instant pointer insertion for new terms / neologisms without retraining Layer 1.
  INVARIANT       : Back-translation invariance (Deepdive 02) — switching between Jargon and Everyday language preserves the exact Layer 1 MOT truth state (1 / 0 / OPEN) and prevents jargon-induced STATE_0/STATE_4 blinding (M4).

LAYER_3_WHO_WE_DEMEANOR_REGISTER (HOW_IT_IS_TONED_TODAY_AND_RING_A_B_C) :
